                    title:                  `Design for Longevity`,
                    subtitle:               `You lead innovation at an award-winning Porto design house entering the silver economy. Your first concept — a “senior assistance lamp” — was rejected: 71% of older testers said it made them feel old. With a €4.0M budget and one launch cycle, redesign for meaning, choose a segment, and build a line that creates personal, business and societal value at once.`,
