                    coach_intro:            `You won awards designing for 30-year-olds, and your first “senior” concept made 71% of testers feel old. This is a design-and-meaning decision, not a feature list. Choose who exactly this is for, decide whether design really changes the product or just its colour, and prove that doing well for the user, the business and society can be the same product — not three things you trade off.`,

